cutor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are directly demonstrated. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete and coherent: node1 was healthy before restart, acknowledged the reboot, changed boot identity from 4d340bf4-0579-47f0-98c1-5c17a66d50f1 to f899e08c-2d8d-4a5a-b9cc-12b266b4fe0e, recovered to a running state with auditd and its rule active, retained the target file unchanged, and passed post-restart successful and unsuccessful audit tests. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the transition.","limitations":[]}
